    <briefdescription>
<para>Basic file status information. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides fundamental file system metadata for files and directories. It serves as a lightweight value type for basic file operations that only require path information and directory status. It can be copied and stored cheaply. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
